{"id":"418252","name":"西红柿蛋花汤","author":"美女天天","authorId":"6241101","desc":"","cover":"images/418252/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"5g"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"20g"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"10g"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"白胡椒粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材备好。","img":"images/418252/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"西红柿去皮切成小块。","img":"images/418252/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"炒锅到适量油烧热。","img":"images/418252/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放点姜丝炸出香味。","img":"images/418252/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"姜丝炸焦捞出。","img":"images/418252/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入切好的西红柿翻炒。","img":"images/418252/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加点盐继续翻炒炒至西红柿变软。","img":"images/418252/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鸡蛋搅散。","img":"images/418252/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加点料酒搅匀，去蛋腥。","img":"images/418252/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"西红柿炒软加入适量水煮开。","img":"images/418252/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒点白胡椒粉。","img":"images/418252/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"用水淀粉勾芡一下。","img":"images/418252/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"关小火加入蛋液。","img":"images/418252/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"蛋液在锅里搅匀。","img":"images/418252/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蛋液成碎碎的雪花片关火撒点葱花，淋上香油美味的番茄鸡蛋汤就好了。","img":"images/418252/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"酸酸甜开胃又好喝。","img":"images/418252/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"打蛋花时要关小火才能打成雪花碎片。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}